=== Prompt ===
Who is Mario from Nintendo?

=== Response ===
Mario is a fictional character and the main character in video games published by Nintendo. He was created by Japanese video game designer Shigeru Miyamoto and first appeared in the 1981 arcade game Donkey Kong. Initially, Mario was named Jumpman, but his name was changed to Mario for the sequel, Mario Bros., which was released in 1983.

Mario is a plumber from Brooklyn, New York, who wears a red cap, overalls, and a mustache. He is known for his ability to jump high and run fast, as well as for his ability to defeat various enemies by stomping on them. Mario's main rival is the villainous Bowser, who often kidnaps Mario's love interest, Princess Peach.

Mario is one of the most iconic and popular video game characters of all time, and has appeared in numerous games, including the Super Mario, Mario Kart, and Super Smash Bros. series. He has also appeared in various other media, such as movies, TV shows, and comic books.

